# Guitar Tool Project Context & Task Tracker

## Current Goals (Requested)

- [x] **String Strokes / Hits:** Improve visual feedback when a string is played (strokes/hits).
- [x] **Sound Sensitivity & Detection:** Optimize YinDetector params, ensure faster and more accurate pitch detection with no errors.
- [x] **UI/UX & Waves:** Enhance WaveVisualizer, make UI responsive for different screen sizes, add landscape mode support.
- [x] **Tuning Instructions & Capo:** Improve the "tune up/down" information display and Capo/Fret placement UI.
- [x] **Routing:** Upgrade/optimize routing (currently React Navigation, considering Expo Router or just polishing the current tabs).

## Progress

- Analyzed existing `useTuner` hook, `WaveVisualizer`, `TunerStateBanner`, and `NoteDisplay`.
- Found `YinDetector` config which can be tuned for better sensitivity.
- [x] Added explicit "string hit / stroke" animations in `WaveVisualizer` using RMS jump logic.
- [x] Added landscape support in `WaveVisualizer` with dynamic width scaling.
- [x] Fixed tuning calibration by using correct sample rate from `expo-audio`.
- [x] Improved noise tolerance in `useTuner` (increased NOISE_GATE_THRESHOLD and StabilityFilter history).
- [x] Verified StringSelector allows manual string selection and plays reference tones.
- [x] Added `playReferenceTone` to `useTuner` when hitting the exact pitch.
- [x] Switched default theme mode to `system` and base `clay` for fully professional claymorphism styling.
- [x] Ensured Cache cleanup is present in Settings (Error Boundary / Stale Build Cache).
